# ==============================================================================
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Fastify/Node diagnostic profiling tools (0x, Clinic.js)
.tap/
out.tap
.clinic/
*clinic*
*flamegraph*
profile-*

